  "summary": "Christophe Van de Weyer, currently Head of Business Unit API at Vonage, to become Head of Business Area Global Communications Platform and CEO of Vonage Niklas Heuveldop to step down on August 15, and remain available up to December 31, 2026, to support orderly and smooth transition to his successor",
